<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Tell NovaDot what you want to improve across software, business systems, digital services or technology operations."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://novadot.co.uk/contact/"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand/novadot-mark.png"><meta name="theme-color" content="#fcfbf8"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Contact NovaDot | Discuss Your Project"><meta property="og:description" content="Tell NovaDot what you want to improve across software, business systems, digital services or technology operations."><meta property="og:url" content="https://novadot.co.uk/contact/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="NovaDot — Independent systems architecture, custom software, and managed cloud operations"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Contact NovaDot | Discuss Your Project"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Tell NovaDot what you want to improve across software, business systems, digital services or technology operations."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><title>Contact NovaDot | Discuss Your Project</title><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"NovaDot","legalName":"NOVADOT LTD","url":"https://novadot.co.uk","logo":"https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-full-logo-hires.png","description":"NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.","email":"hello@novadot.co.uk","telephone":"+44 (0)116 436 1235","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"First Floor, 18B Tithe Street","addressLocality":"Leicester","addressRegion":"Leicestershire","postalCode":"LE5 4BN","addressCountry":"GB"}}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ArcGraphic.DOqw_ipj.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/contact.D6-Vbxwy.css"><script defer src="https://scanner.novadot.co.uk/novadot-analytics.v1.072ff0e7fc53.js" integrity="sha384-5sIvO4uGVSOkyWi+5uhod+c65rFwppXlcnGxsJSiig2jKQ2Vvn8YtmfbDYCnz1CG" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" data-site="nd_ne8NN6cbqgvgMTNvcC_zIfoY47NW8pSs" data-routes="%2F,%2Fabout,%2Fcontact"></script>
</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/" aria-current="page">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero page-hero--compact"><div class="shell page-hero__compact-inner"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Contact NovaDot</p><h1>Tell us what you want to improve.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">Describe what you are looking to build, connect, repair or improve. You do not need to choose a technology service first.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="contact-heading" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><div class="shell contact-layout" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><!-- Structured Project Intake Form --><div class="contact-form-column" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><div class="form-header" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Project enquiry</p><h2 id="contact-heading" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Tell us about your project</h2><p class="form-lead" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>We begin with a conversation about your goals, current systems and constraints before recommending a practical next step.</p></div><!-- Outside a dialog, method="dialog" prevents native submissions from
             sending personal details if JavaScript is absent or interrupted. --><form class="problem-form" id="contact-form" method="dialog" novalidate data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><p class="form-lead" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Submit your enquiry directly to NovaDot. You can also email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>hello@novadot.co.uk</a> directly.</p><noscript><p data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Online submission needs JavaScript. Please send your enquiry directly to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>hello@novadot.co.uk</a>.</p></noscript><div class="form-honeypot" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-website" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Leave this field empty</label><input id="contact-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></div><div class="form-group-row" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-name" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Your name <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>*</span></label><input type="text" id="contact-name" name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="First and last name" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span class="field-error" id="error-name" data-error-for="name" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-email" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Work email <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>*</span></label><input type="email" id="contact-email" name="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@organisation.co.uk" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span class="field-error" id="error-email" data-error-for="email" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div></div><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-org" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Organisation <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>*</span></label><input type="text" id="contact-org" name="organisation" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company or organisation name" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span class="field-error" id="error-org" data-error-for="organisation" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-problem" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>What would you like to build or improve? <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>*</span></label><span class="field-help" id="problem-help" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Briefly describe what you want to achieve or where the current friction appears.</span><textarea id="contact-problem" name="problem" rows="4" required maxlength="5000" aria-describedby="problem-help" placeholder="e.g. Orders from our website must be manually re-keyed into our accounting system..." data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></textarea><span class="field-error" id="error-problem" data-error-for="problem" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-consequence" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>How does this affect your team or customers?</label><span class="field-help" id="consequence-help" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>For example: repeated administration, delays, missed enquiries or unreliable access.</span><textarea id="contact-consequence" name="consequence" rows="3" maxlength="3000" aria-describedby="consequence-help" placeholder="e.g. 15 hours lost each week, recurring reconciliation errors at month end..." data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></textarea><span class="field-error" id="error-consequence" data-error-for="consequence" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-group-row" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-system" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Current system, process or digital journey</label><input type="text" id="contact-system" name="system" maxlength="500" placeholder="e.g. Spreadsheets, Odoo, Sage, Custom PHP, AWS" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span class="field-error" id="error-system" data-error-for="system" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-group" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-timing" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Is there a decision date or deadline?</label><input type="text" id="contact-timing" name="timing" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Next quarter, within 30 days" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span class="field-error" id="error-timing" data-error-for="timing" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div></div><fieldset class="form-group form-fieldset" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><legend data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Preferred contact method</legend><div class="radio-row" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label class="radio-label" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><input type="radio" name="preference" value="email" checked data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Email</span></label><label class="radio-label" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><input type="radio" name="preference" value="phone" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Phone call</span></label></div><span class="field-error" id="error-preference" data-error-for="preference" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></fieldset><div class="form-group" id="phone-field-group" hidden data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label for="contact-phone" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Telephone number <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>*</span></label><input type="tel" id="contact-phone" name="phone" maxlength="40" placeholder="e.g. +44 (0)116 436 1235" autocomplete="tel" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span class="field-error" id="error-phone" data-error-for="phone" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-group form-privacy-box" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><label class="checkbox-label" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><input type="checkbox" id="contact-privacy" name="privacy" required data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><span data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>I understand NovaDot will use these details to assess and respond to this enquiry. Do not send passwords, health information, payment data or confidential production records through this form. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-link" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label><span class="field-error" id="error-privacy" data-error-for="privacy" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></span></div><div class="form-actions" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><button type="submit" class="button button--primary" id="submit-btn" disabled data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Submit enquiry</button></div><div class="form-message" id="form-success" data-form-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><h3 data-feedback-heading data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></h3><p data-feedback-message data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh></p><div class="form-message__secondary" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-new-enquiry hidden data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Start a separate enquiry</button></div></div></form></div><!-- Direct Details & Due Diligence Sidebar --><aside class="contact-aside" aria-labelledby="direct-details-title" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><div class="aside-box" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Contact details</p><h2 id="direct-details-title" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Get in touch directly</h2><p class="aside-lead" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>If you already have a structured brief or prefer direct communication, you can contact us directly.</p><dl class="contact-methods" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><div class="method-item" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><dt data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Email</dt><dd data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><a class="contact-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>hello@novadot.co.uk</a></dd></div><div class="method-item" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><dt data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Telephone</dt><dd data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><a class="contact-link" href="tel:+441164361235" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>+44 (0)116 436 1235</a></dd></div><div class="method-item" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><dt data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Office / correspondence address</dt><dd data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>First Floor, 18B Tithe Street, Leicester, LE5 4BN</dd></div><div class="method-item" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><dt data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Registered office</dt><dd data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>21 Berkeley Close, Oadby, Leicester, England, LE2 4SZ</dd></div></dl><div class="access-sidebar-note" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><p data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><strong data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Visiting note:</strong> Office meetings strictly by prior confirmed appointment. The premises are on the first floor and reached by stairs only (no lift).</p></div></div><div class="aside-box aside-box--facts" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>How we work together</p><h3 data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Agreed scope before quoting</h3><p data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Tell us what you want to achieve, who uses the system and any deadline or constraints. If an assessment is needed, we will agree its scope and any fee before starting.</p><ul class="aside-checklist" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><li data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Clear guidance on whether we are a fit</li><li data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>No charge for initial exploratory conversations</li><li data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Deliverables, acceptance checks and support agreed upfront</li></ul><p class="aside-more-link" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh><a class="text-link" href="/how-we-work/#commercial-terms" data-astro-cid-6bfsojfh>Learn about our commercial terms &rarr;</a></p></div></aside></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html><script type="module" src="/_astro/contact.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang._QOMaRgG.js"></script>